Package: camelsafr
Type: Package
Title: R Client for the CAMELS-Afr African Basin Hydrological Database
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Maria", "Niranjan", email = "M.Niranjan@cgiar.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides one-line access to the CAMELS-Afr dataset of 216
    basin attributes and 44 years of daily climate timeseries for African
    river basins across four spatial levels (L1-L4). Data is fetched from
    a CloudFront-hosted Parquet store using the arrow package.
